  <div id="sutta">
  
            <h4 id="thag2.3" class="h1">Thag 2:3  Valliya</h4>
            <div class="verse">
              <p>A monkey,</p>
              <p>coming to the little hut</p>
              <p>with five doors,</p>
              <p>goes from door to door, knocking</p>
              <p>moment by moment.</p>
              <p class="v2">Stand still, monkey,</p>
              <p class="v2">don’t run.</p>
              <p>It’s not yours</p>
              <p>as it was before.</p>
              <p>You’re bound by discernment.</p>
              <p>You won’t get far away.</p>
            </div><!--end verse-->
            <p class="seealso">See also: <a href="../../SN/SN35_199.html">SN 35:199</a></p><!--end seealso-->
      </div><!--end:sutta-->
    </div><!--end:content-->
    
